%% Figure: Authority action and multisig governance workflow.
%% Render to: Images/Chapter 3/authority-workflow.png
flowchart TD
    A["Authority signs in with MetaMask"] --> B["Authority claims an Open or Reopened report"]
    B --> C["Report becomes InProgress"]
    C --> D["Authority posts optional progress updates and image evidence"]
    D --> E{"Outcome of the work"}
    E -- "Issue fixed" --> F["Authority marks the report as solved with evidence"]
    F --> G["Report becomes PendingVerification"]
    E -- "Issue invalid" --> H["Authority rejects the report"]
    H --> I["Report becomes PendingRejectionReview"]

    SA["Super Admins submit and approve a proposal"] --> Q{"Approvals reach floor(N/2) + 1?"}
    Q -- No --> W["Proposal remains open"]
    Q -- Yes --> X["Proposal executes: authority roster or voting method updated"]
    X --> A
